        "subject": "LU-20276 tests: Reclaim space before/after running sanityn test (2.4.0)",
        "message": "LU-20276 tests: Reclaim space before/after running sanityn test (2.4.0)\n\ntest_56b causes OOM in test_70/71 in 1/40 run since\nusing ZFS 2.4. This patch add function 'zfs_wait_free_osts'\nto reclaim free space in function 56a and 56b before they\nend.\n\nThis patch also enables test_56b. To check if OOM is\ntriggered after zfs_wait_free_osts function.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el9.7\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el9.8\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.1\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.2\nSigned-off-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nChange-Id: Ib4a3de285b4826b26efed41fdcbb90fcd0e307d6\n"
      },
